    "policy": "// Compiled by legate-standard-compiler.v1 from the signed standard's structured requirements.\n// The standard carries this file's digest (acta-policy-digest-v1). Edit the standard, not this file.\n// Allowed tools: monid_discover, monid_inspect, monid_run. The name must match exactly. The gate does not read the tool's input.\n// Network, model route, attempts, time, and the task set are not visible here; the environment enforces the first two and the manifest carries the rest.\n\npermit (\n  principal,\n  action == Action::\"MCP::Tool::call\",\n  resource\n) when {\n  resource in [Tool::\"monid_discover\", Tool::\"monid_inspect\", Tool::\"monid_run\"]\n};\n\nforbid (\n  principal,\n  action == Action::\"MCP::Tool::call\",\n  resource\n) unless {\n  resource in [Tool::\"monid_discover\", Tool::\"monid_inspect\", Tool::\"monid_run\"]\n};\n",
